        "description": "Replace Effect.async with Effect.callback. Effect.callback registers asynchronous work and resumes the operation through a callback. Keep registration inside the callback and return its cleanup Effect to release resources on interruption. Use Stream for a sequence of events and acquire/release for resource lifetimes.",
